  "body": [
    "This site will provide you with a quick overview of the press portal. You're searching for a specific topic? Please use our press search.",
    "Find what you’re looking for fast:",
    "Press contacts Newsletter Pictures & Videos Figures | Data | Facts Mobility Studies Sale of ContiTech",
    "Please find here a selection of recommended news, as well as the latest news.",
    "September 16, 2026 Continental has significantly expanded its global portfolio of ultra-high-performance (UHP) tires – tires measuring 18 inches and above – over the past five years and plans to strengthen this segment further in the future. By the end of 2027, the company will add more than 650 new tire sizes across all tire lines, for both original equipment on new cars and the replacement market. By expanding its portfolio, the tire manufacturer is responding to growing demand for high-performance tires designed for larger, heavier and more powerful vehicles, as well as electrified drive systems, while laying the foundation for further profitable growth in this segment.",
    "September 29, 2026 Continental has received two new approvals to supply original-equipment tires for Porsche models. The automotive manufacturer has approved both the SportContact 7 and the new SportContact 7 Force for the Panamera G3 II. The SportContact 7 Force is a high-performance addition to Continental’s summer tire line. Porsche also recommends the WinterContact TS 860 S for the Cayenne E4 during the colder months.",
    "September 15, 2026 Continental is expanding its Conti Scandinavia winter tire portfolio with a new 315/60 R 22.5 steering axle tire.",
    "August 25, 2026 As part of the EU-funded ZEvRA project, Continental has developed a concept tire made from around 43 percent recycled materials. The concept tire highlights the potential of innovative material approaches. It also demonstrates the need for a reliable framework when adopting recycling technologies on an industrial scale.",
    "The Annual Shareholders' Meeting took place on Thursday, April 30, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. in the form of a presence meeting.",
    "New ContiSportAttack 5 combines racetrack DNA with road suitability.",
    "On March 4, Continental has presented the preliminary results of fiscal 2025 and provided an outlook for the current fiscal year.",
    "Please find an overview about all upcoming events as well as detailed press information about past events on our site Fairs & Events.",
    "Continental Mobility Studies:",
    "Key findings from the Continental Mobility Studies from 2011 to 2024.",
    "What are the challenges facing electric mobility? How much do people trust automated and autonomous driving? And how important is it in life to have your own vehicle?Since 2011, our biennial representative mobility studies have documented people’s attitudes, expectations and concerns on the topic of transport and mobility. What originally began as a snapshot of driving sentiment has since evolved into a barometer for mobility trends. Our studies are now among the most comprehensive of their kind, regularly surveying drivers in countries including Germany, France, China and the USA.",
    "Here are the five most important findings: When Mobility Changes",
